claude: true
prompt: >
  Pick the next actionable ticket from this MCP-Picnic board and complete it.
  Delegate behavior-relevant code to the mcp-picnic-worker agent; use
  mcp-picnic-test-writer for tests and mcp-picnic-pod-writer for POD. Keep tests
  network-free. Never run `dzil release` or any CPAN upload. Record any drift you
  find as a new karr ticket rather than expanding scope mid-change.
